cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software version and the revised manuscript; include a release identifier when available."
type: software
title: "Reproducible checks for tracial commutator transport diagnostics"
authors:
  - family-names: Filardo
    given-names: Gautier-Edouard
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-8310-2065"
version: "0.3.0"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary implementation for the revised transport-diagnostic manuscript.
  Exact toral maps, Fourier cutoff bounds, small-time energy response, shear
  counterexamples and trajectories of a decaying Beltrami velocity.
  No Navier-Stokes regularity criterion or singularity solver is provided.
